  "accepts_game_password": true,
  "requirements_html": "<p><strong>Recommended teams:</strong></p><ul><li>LR Meli, SheMeli, SheBan, R King</li><li>Odin, Gawain, G Tyr, G Hel</li></ul><p><strong>License key needed.</strong> Paste your key here the first time you use a private Farmer. Don't have a key yet? Ask us for a free one. Once it works, we'll remember it securely on this Windows account, so you won't need to enter it again.</p><p>You'll need an internet connection whenever you start a private Farmer. Each key can only be used on the first computer it activates.</p><p>Set your Surtr team before starting. The Farmer supports teams with or without Odin and stops after your chosen number of clears.</p>",
